      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## PowerScale - Client Summary Stats\n\nPer-client protocol activity, throughput, and latency from OneFS client summary statistics. Identifies busiest or highest-latency clients on the cluster.\n\nRequires `client = true` in the `[summary_stats]` section of the gostats collector configuration.\n\n**Cardinality warning:** Client summary stats have high tag/label cardinality (remote_addr x protocol x class x node). On large clusters with many clients this can impact database performance.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
